{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game adds a twist to the Rogue-like Deck builder genre by separating the combat in two phases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the first phase you will load your revolver with the cards you want to use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Then, the shooting begins, where you will &quot;shoot&quot; your cards one by one, while the enemy &quot;shoots&quot; back in-between. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/cftw_combat_overview.gif?t=1742804418\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each game takes place in a new unique map where cards battles won't be the only way to progress and upgrade your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will find duels, where the faster shooter wins!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Saloons were you will find good deals on cards to add to your deck and have a drink to help you recover some health (don't drink too much or you will get dizzy).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And more...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/extras/cftw_map_overview.gif?t=1742804418\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal is to beat the boss at the end of the level to go further into more complicated and fun encounters as your deck of cards evolves.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2081790?t=1742804418","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2081790?t=1742804418","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742804418","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2081790/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742804418","categories":[{"description":"Si